### BUG-006 — Any User Can Switch Their Role to Admin
- **Severity:** 🔴 Critical
- **Category:** Security
- **Component:** [server.ts](file:///Users/satyam/Documents/Development%20Log%20/WebMedia/Neet-PG-Crack/server.ts#L104-L113)
