### BUG-011 — `createPool()` Called on Every Health Check — Connection Pool Leak
- **Severity:** 🟠 High
- **Category:** Performance / Infrastructure
- **Component:** [server.ts](file:///Users/satyam/Documents/Development%20Log%20/WebMedia/Neet-PG-Crack/server.ts#L73-L90)
- **Summary:** `app.get('/api/health')` calls `createPool()` on EVERY request. If `createPool` creates a new Pool instance (common pg pattern), this leaks connection pools. Under load with Kubernetes health probes hitting every 10s, this will exhaust database connections.
